Package: pob2ef
Title: Partially Optimized Bayesian Phase II Efficacy and Futility
        Design
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Feinan",
           family = "Lu",
           email = "feinan.lu@hotmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a partially optimized Bayesian single-arm phase II
    design for a binary efficacy endpoint with efficacy and futility stopping.
    The design searches candidate response-count boundaries and, subject to
    prespecified error constraints, selects the design that minimizes the
    grey-zone at the final look. The package creates decision tables and
    evaluates operating characteristics by exact trial-path enumeration or
    Monte Carlo simulation.
